00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:48.414
instead of saying sign up now.

00:16:48.414 --> 00:16:50.490
Instead of an infomercial,

00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:52.340
make a B2B magazine.

00:16:52.340 --> 00:16:55.603
It could be even not even
about your own product.

00:16:56.610 --> 00:16:58.540
- Yeah, we've got this big,

00:16:58.540 --> 00:16:59.528
so the reason I'm here

00:16:59.528 --> 00:17:00.868
